  "duration_s": 478.260998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "消失二十八年回来只剩半条命，妻子翻出他证件，当场哭瘫。原来你是国家的人家人们，我先问大家一个问题，一个男人、妻子、父母、孩子全都不知道他在哪在干什么，一消失就是二十八年，他到底在为国家做什么？他叫邓稼先，三十四岁那年，接下任务，从此人间蒸发。等他再出出现在妻子面前时，只剩半条命，手里捏着一张皱巴巴的纸，上面写着一句话，不要让人家把我们落得太远。今天我把这个课本没讲完的故事给你讲完时间倒回。一九五八年，那时候的邓稼先才三十四岁，刚从美国留学回来，是国内顶尖的核物理专家。他有体面的工作，有贤惠的妻子，一双可爱的儿女，日子过得安稳又幸福。可就在这一年，领导找他谈话，只说了一句话，国家要放一个大炮仗，需要你去做。邓稼先瞬间就懂了，这是国家最高级别的机密，这一去就意味着隐姓埋名，不能告诉任何人，自己去哪，连父母都不能说。那天晚上回家，他看着熟睡的孩子，看着忙前忙后的妻子，心里像刀割一样。他跟妻子许路熹说，我要调动工作了。去很远的地方以后，家里的事儿就都靠你了。妻子问他去哪去多久，做什么，他只能摇头，不能说你就当我死了都行。但你相信我，我做的这件事儿这辈子都值得。第二天一早，他拎着一个简单的行李箱，头也不回的走了。这一走就是整整二十八年。他去了荒无人烟的戈壁滩，去了连地图上都找不到的罗布泊，那地方有多酷？夏天地表温度四五十度，沙子烫的能烤熟鸡蛋。冬天零下三十多度飞沙走石，房子都能给你掀翻，吃的是夹着沙子的窝窝头，喝的是盐碱地的苦水，连口新鲜蔬菜都吃不上，比环境更苦的是技术上的难。外国人卡，我们脖子什么资料都不给，没有计算机，他们就用算盘算几拨人轮班倒，一天算十几个小时，算出来的草稿纸堆的比人都高，最难熬的是对家人的思念，他不能打电话，不能写信，连自己是死是活，家里人都不知道。有一次，母亲病重，家里连发十几封电报，催他回去。他攥着电报，在戈壁滩上，对着家的方向跪了很久，最后还是没回去，不是不想回是不能回啊。那时候正是原子弹研制最关键的时候，他走了，整个项目都要受影响，就这么熬啊熬。一九六四年，中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功，一九六七年第一颗氢弹爆炸成功，整个世界都震惊了。可没有人知道，这背后有一个叫邓稼先的人，把自己的青春、健康甚至命都搭进去了。真正让他落下病根的是一九七九年的一次核实验。那天，一枚核弹从飞机上投下来降落伞突然出了故障，弹体直直砸在地上，摔碎了。家人们。核弹摔碎了，意味着什么？强辐射当场就散出来。现场所有人包括最专业的防化兵，都本能的往后退，只有一个人没有退。邓稼先甩开旁边拽他的手，一个人冲了上去，有人喊他，邓院长，你不能去，你站远点，让年轻人去，他头也没回，只说了一句话，这是我负责的。我不去让谁去，他蹲在地上，亲手把那些粘着强辐射的碎片一块一块捧起来，仔细查看，足足在里面待了几十分钟，等他走出来的时候，脸色煞白，嘴唇发紫，站都站不稳。可他开口第一句话是问题站不了，大家不用怕了，就是那几十分钟，核辐射像刀子一样，一刀一刀刮走了他身体里最宝贵的东西。起。从那以后，他的头发开始大把大把的掉，经常变血，免疫力全面崩塌，可他谁也没告诉第二天照常上班，照常开会，照常往最危险的现场跑。他是知道的。他知道自己身体里埋着一颗倒计时的炸弹，可他从来没跟任何人提起过，他只在心里默默默想。时间不多了，那就再多干一点。直到一九八六年，他实在撑不住了，才被强行送进医院。这时候，他的身份才终于对外公开。妻子许路兮，这才知道，自己等了二十八年的丈夫。原来是中国的两弹元勋，是为国家立了天大功劳的人。可一切都晚了，医生说，他的癌细胞已经扩散到了全身住院的最后那段日子。他疼的整宿整宿睡不着觉，可他从来不说疼，还在跟同事讨论工作，还在写后续的发展规划。临终前，他还是那句话，不要让人家把我们落得太远。一九八六年七月二十九日，邓稼先永远的闭上了眼睛，享年六十二岁。家人们，他本来可以留在美国过优渥的生活，可他选择了隐姓埋名，选择了戈壁滩。把自己的一生藏在大漠深处，连家人都不能告诉没有他这样的傻子，哪有我们今天的安稳日子，觉得邓老是真英雄的在评论区打上国事无双四个字，让更多人记住他。把这条视频转到家庭群，让儿子、儿媳、孙子、孙女都看看什么才叫值得追的星。记得点个收藏，哪天孩子写作业累了，不想学了，翻出来放给他听，比骂一百句都管用。关注我，明天继续讲下一位国之几两，像邓稼先这样的故事书里，还有整整四十位，每一个都值得你读给孩子听。这本书叫国之几两。链接放在左下角小了，感兴趣可以拍下来，放在枕边，细细品读。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 3470,
      "text": "消失二十八年回来只剩半条命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4010,
      "end_ms": 5510,
      "text": "妻子翻出他证件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5550,
      "end_ms": 6470,
      "text": "当场哭瘫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6950,
      "end_ms": 9590,
      "text": "原来你是国家的人家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9770,
      "end_ms": 11450,
      "text": "我先问大家一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11750,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "一个男人、妻子、父母、孩子全都不知道他在哪在干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18290,
      "end_ms": 20570,
      "text": "一消失就是二十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20570,
      "end_ms": 22490,
      "text": "他到底在为国家做什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22790,
      "end_ms": 23870,
      "text": "他叫邓稼先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24290,
      "end_ms": 25550,
      "text": "三十四岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25570,
      "end_ms": 26330,
      "text": "接下任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26750,
      "end_ms": 28670,
      "text": "从此人间蒸发。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29350,
      "end_ms": 31480,
      "text": "等他再出出现在妻子面前时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31960,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "只剩半条命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33720,
      "end_ms": 35860,
      "text": "手里捏着一张皱巴巴的纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 37100,
      "text": "上面写着一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 40280,
      "text": "不要让人家把我们落得太远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41100,
      "end_ms": 47400,
      "text": "今天我把这个课本没讲完的故事给你讲完时间倒回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 47640,
      "end_ms": 48540,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50040,
      "end_ms": 53020,
      "text": "那时候的邓稼先才三十四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53920,
      "end_ms": 55600,
      "text": "刚从美国留学回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55760,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "是国内顶尖的核物理专家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59300,
      "end_ms": 60855,
      "text": "他有体面的工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61220,
      "end_ms": 62645,
      "text": "有贤惠的妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63060,
      "end_ms": 64455,
      "text": "一双可爱的儿女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64870,
      "end_ms": 66945,
      "text": "日子过得安稳又幸福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 67520,
      "end_ms": 68645,
      "text": "可就在这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68970,
      "end_ms": 70165,
      "text": "领导找他谈话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70720,
      "end_ms": 71815,
      "text": "只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 72680,
      "end_ms": 74380,
      "text": "国家要放一个大炮仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74420,
      "end_ms": 75465,
      "text": "需要你去做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76500,
      "end_ms": 78345,
      "text": "邓稼先瞬间就懂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79360,
      "end_ms": 81605,
      "text": "这是国家最高级别的机密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82510,
      "end_ms": 86105,
      "text": "这一去就意味着隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87170,
      "end_ms": 88430,
      "text": "不能告诉任何人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 88430,
      "end_ms": 89255,
      "text": "自己去哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90960,
      "end_ms": 92455,
      "text": "连父母都不能说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 92890,
      "end_ms": 94005,
      "text": "那天晚上回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94270,
      "end_ms": 95735,
      "text": "他看着熟睡的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 96160,
      "end_ms": 97945,
      "text": "看着忙前忙后的妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 98280,
      "end_ms": 99795,
      "text": "心里像刀割一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 100600,
      "end_ms": 102235,
      "text": "他跟妻子许路熹说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103080,
      "end_ms": 104565,
      "text": "我要调动工作了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105170,
      "end_ms": 107360,
      "text": "去很远的地方以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 107360,
      "end_ms": 110285,
      "text": "家里的事儿就都靠你了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 111300,
      "end_ms": 114585,
      "text": "妻子问他去哪去多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 116400,
      "end_ms": 116940,
      "text": "做什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 116940,
      "end_ms": 118075,
      "text": "他只能摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 118970,
      "end_ms": 122435,
      "text": "不能说你就当我死了都行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 124445,
      "text": "但你相信我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 125590,
      "end_ms": 129395,
      "text": "我做的这件事儿这辈子都值得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 130760,
      "end_ms": 131645,
      "text": "第二天一早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 132560,
      "end_ms": 134875,
      "text": "他拎着一个简单的行李箱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 135360,
      "end_ms": 136575,
      "text": "头也不回的走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 137610,
      "end_ms": 141145,
      "text": "这一走就是整整二十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 142240,
      "end_ms": 144755,
      "text": "他去了荒无人烟的戈壁滩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 145690,
      "end_ms": 149035,
      "text": "去了连地图上都找不到的罗布泊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 150580,
      "end_ms": 151775,
      "text": "那地方有多酷？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 152220,
      "end_ms": 154365,
      "text": "夏天地表温度四五十度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 154900,
      "end_ms": 156945,
      "text": "沙子烫的能烤熟鸡蛋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 157400,
      "end_ms": 160510,
      "text": "冬天零下三十多度飞沙走石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 160750,
      "end_ms": 162385,
      "text": "房子都能给你掀翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 163180,
      "end_ms": 165265,
      "text": "吃的是夹着沙子的窝窝头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 165630,
      "end_ms": 167505,
      "text": "喝的是盐碱地的苦水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 168220,
      "end_ms": 170455,
      "text": "连口新鲜蔬菜都吃不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 171200,
      "end_ms": 174335,
      "text": "比环境更苦的是技术上的难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 174800,
      "end_ms": 175680,
      "text": "外国人卡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 175700,
      "end_ms": 178025,
      "text": "我们脖子什么资料都不给，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 178380,
      "end_ms": 179300,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 179580,
      "end_ms": 183020,
      "text": "他们就用算盘算几拨人轮班倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 183260,
      "end_ms": 184955,
      "text": "一天算十几个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 185440,
      "end_ms": 187865,
      "text": "算出来的草稿纸堆的比人都高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 188410,
      "end_ms": 191425,
      "text": "最难熬的是对家人的思念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 192050,
      "end_ms": 193290,
      "text": "他不能打电话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 193470,
      "end_ms": 194345,
      "text": "不能写信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 194820,
      "end_ms": 196720,
      "text": "连自己是死是活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 196940,
      "end_ms": 198295,
      "text": "家里人都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 198580,
      "end_ms": 199000,
      "text": "有一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 199000,
      "end_ms": 199805,
      "text": "母亲病重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 200100,
      "end_ms": 202215,
      "text": "家里连发十几封电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 202500,
      "end_ms": 203285,
      "text": "催他回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 203850,
      "end_ms": 205095,
      "text": "他攥着电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 205300,
      "end_ms": 206220,
      "text": "在戈壁滩上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206280,
      "end_ms": 208335,
      "text": "对着家的方向跪了很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 208840,
      "end_ms": 210385,
      "text": "最后还是没回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 211060,
      "end_ms": 213715,
      "text": "不是不想回是不能回啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 214640,
      "end_ms": 217505,
      "text": "那时候正是原子弹研制最关键的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 217730,
      "end_ms": 218355,
      "text": "他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 218770,
      "end_ms": 220555,
      "text": "整个项目都要受影响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 220890,
      "end_ms": 222480,
      "text": "就这么熬啊熬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 222780,
      "end_ms": 223945,
      "text": "一九六四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 224490,
      "end_ms": 227275,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 227940,
      "end_ms": 231455,
      "text": "一九六七年第一颗氢弹爆炸成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 231930,
      "end_ms": 233510,
      "text": "整个世界都震惊了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 233510,
      "end_ms": 234655,
      "text": "可没有人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 235670,
      "end_ms": 238375,
      "text": "这背后有一个叫邓稼先的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 239330,
      "end_ms": 244305,
      "text": "把自己的青春、健康甚至命都搭进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 245330,
      "end_ms": 250945,
      "text": "真正让他落下病根的是一九七九年的一次核实验。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 251400,
      "end_ms": 251935,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 254430,
      "end_ms": 259205,
      "text": "一枚核弹从飞机上投下来降落伞突然出了故障，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 259640,
      "end_ms": 261360,
      "text": "弹体直直砸在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 261580,
      "end_ms": 262265,
      "text": "摔碎了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 264810,
      "end_ms": 265355,
      "text": "家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 265830,
      "end_ms": 267005,
      "text": "核弹摔碎了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 269840,
      "end_ms": 270725,
      "text": "意味着什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 271060,
      "end_ms": 273055,
      "text": "强辐射当场就散出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 273720,
      "end_ms": 277075,
      "text": "现场所有人包括最专业的防化兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 277450,
      "end_ms": 278890,
      "text": "都本能的往后退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 279050,
      "end_ms": 280945,
      "text": "只有一个人没有退。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 281440,
      "end_ms": 283485,
      "text": "邓稼先甩开旁边拽他的手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 283810,
      "end_ms": 284905,
      "text": "一个人冲了上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 285370,
      "end_ms": 286195,
      "text": "有人喊他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 286560,
      "end_ms": 287075,
      "text": "邓院长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287250,
      "end_ms": 287905,
      "text": "你不能去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 288190,
      "end_ms": 288935,
      "text": "你站远点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 289240,
      "end_ms": 290085,
      "text": "让年轻人去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 290790,
      "end_ms": 291735,
      "text": "他头也没回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 292140,
      "end_ms": 293100,
      "text": "只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 293300,
      "end_ms": 294315,
      "text": "这是我负责的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 294830,
      "end_ms": 296250,
      "text": "我不去让谁去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 297210,
      "end_ms": 298230,
      "text": "他蹲在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 298550,
      "end_ms": 302430,
      "text": "亲手把那些粘着强辐射的碎片一块一块捧起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 302790,
      "end_ms": 303670,
      "text": "仔细查看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 304470,
      "end_ms": 306970,
      "text": "足足在里面待了几十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 307590,
      "end_ms": 309130,
      "text": "等他走出来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 309430,
      "end_ms": 310450,
      "text": "脸色煞白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 310830,
      "end_ms": 311870,
      "text": "嘴唇发紫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 311970,
      "end_ms": 313130,
      "text": "站都站不稳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 313370,
      "end_ms": 316250,
      "text": "可他开口第一句话是问题站不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 316330,
      "end_ms": 317510,
      "text": "大家不用怕了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 317750,
      "end_ms": 318990,
      "text": "就是那几十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 319230,
      "end_ms": 320970,
      "text": "核辐射像刀子一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 321230,
      "end_ms": 324540,
      "text": "一刀一刀刮走了他身体里最宝贵的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 325400,
      "end_ms": 325600,
      "text": "起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 325600,
      "end_ms": 326680,
      "text": "从那以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 326680,
      "end_ms": 329300,
      "text": "他的头发开始大把大把的掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 329320,
      "end_ms": 330840,
      "text": "经常变血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 330880,
      "end_ms": 333080,
      "text": "免疫力全面崩塌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 333080,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "可他谁也没告诉第二天照常上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 336800,
      "end_ms": 338600,
      "text": "照常开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00141",
      "start_ms": 338600,
      "end_ms": 341340,
      "text": "照常往最危险的现场跑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00142",
      "start_ms": 341340,
      "end_ms": 343320,
      "text": "他是知道的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00143",
      "start_ms": 343340,
      "end_ms": 346740,
      "text": "他知道自己身体里埋着一颗倒计时的炸弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00144",
      "start_ms": 346740,
      "end_ms": 349520,
      "text": "可他从来没跟任何人提起过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00145",
      "start_ms": 349520,
      "end_ms": 351040,
      "text": "他只在心里默默默想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00146",
      "start_ms": 351440,
      "end_ms": 352540,
      "text": "时间不多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00147",
      "start_ms": 352820,
      "end_ms": 354305,
      "text": "那就再多干一点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00148",
      "start_ms": 354900,
      "end_ms": 356200,
      "text": "直到一九八六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00149",
      "start_ms": 356380,
      "end_ms": 357715,
      "text": "他实在撑不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00150",
      "start_ms": 358200,
      "end_ms": 360455,
      "text": "才被强行送进医院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00151",
      "start_ms": 361310,
      "end_ms": 361985,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00152",
      "start_ms": 362310,
      "end_ms": 365305,
      "text": "他的身份才终于对外公开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00153",
      "start_ms": 366310,
      "end_ms": 367390,
      "text": "妻子许路兮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00154",
      "start_ms": 367410,
      "end_ms": 368245,
      "text": "这才知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00155",
      "start_ms": 368520,
      "end_ms": 370800,
      "text": "自己等了二十八年的丈夫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00156",
      "start_ms": 371120,
      "end_ms": 373455,
      "text": "原来是中国的两弹元勋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00157",
      "start_ms": 374000,
      "end_ms": 377005,
      "text": "是为国家立了天大功劳的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00158",
      "start_ms": 377800,
      "end_ms": 379145,
      "text": "可一切都晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00159",
      "start_ms": 379660,
      "end_ms": 380395,
      "text": "医生说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00160",
      "start_ms": 380800,
      "end_ms": 386015,
      "text": "他的癌细胞已经扩散到了全身住院的最后那段日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00161",
      "start_ms": 386680,
      "end_ms": 388925,
      "text": "他疼的整宿整宿睡不着觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00162",
      "start_ms": 389780,
      "end_ms": 391035,
      "text": "可他从来不说疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00163",
      "start_ms": 391660,
      "end_ms": 393515,
      "text": "还在跟同事讨论工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00164",
      "start_ms": 393890,
      "end_ms": 395785,
      "text": "还在写后续的发展规划。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00165",
      "start_ms": 397690,
      "end_ms": 398475,
      "text": "临终前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00166",
      "start_ms": 399070,
      "end_ms": 400165,
      "text": "他还是那句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00167",
      "start_ms": 400660,
      "end_ms": 402695,
      "text": "不要让人家把我们落得太远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00168",
      "start_ms": 404090,
      "end_ms": 406225,
      "text": "一九八六年七月二十九日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00169",
      "start_ms": 406960,
      "end_ms": 409555,
      "text": "邓稼先永远的闭上了眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00170",
      "start_ms": 410420,
      "end_ms": 412055,
      "text": "享年六十二岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00171",
      "start_ms": 413450,
      "end_ms": 413975,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00172",
      "start_ms": 414420,
      "end_ms": 417960,
      "text": "他本来可以留在美国过优渥的生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00173",
      "start_ms": 418320,
      "end_ms": 420420,
      "text": "可他选择了隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00174",
      "start_ms": 420900,
      "end_ms": 422160,
      "text": "选择了戈壁滩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00175",
      "start_ms": 422700,
      "end_ms": 425620,
      "text": "把自己的一生藏在大漠深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00176",
      "start_ms": 425740,
      "end_ms": 429080,
      "text": "连家人都不能告诉没有他这样的傻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00177",
      "start_ms": 429500,
      "end_ms": 431900,
      "text": "哪有我们今天的安稳日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00178",
      "start_ms": 432380,
      "end_ms": 437820,
      "text": "觉得邓老是真英雄的在评论区打上国事无双四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00179",
      "start_ms": 438320,
      "end_ms": 439800,
      "text": "让更多人记住他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00180",
      "start_ms": 440800,
      "end_ms": 443060,
      "text": "把这条视频转到家庭群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00181",
      "start_ms": 443060,
      "end_ms": 449590,
      "text": "让儿子、儿媳、孙子、孙女都看看什么才叫值得追的星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00182",
      "start_ms": 450510,
      "end_ms": 451630,
      "text": "记得点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00183",
      "start_ms": 451990,
      "end_ms": 453710,
      "text": "哪天孩子写作业累了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00184",
      "start_ms": 454130,
      "end_ms": 455090,
      "text": "不想学了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00185",
      "start_ms": 455330,
      "end_ms": 456710,
      "text": "翻出来放给他听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00186",
      "start_ms": 457250,
      "end_ms": 459470,
      "text": "比骂一百句都管用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00187",
      "start_ms": 460010,
      "end_ms": 460730,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00188",
      "start_ms": 460930,
      "end_ms": 463650,
      "text": "明天继续讲下一位国之几两，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00189",
      "start_ms": 463890,
      "end_ms": 466590,
      "text": "像邓稼先这样的故事书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00190",
      "start_ms": 466590,
      "end_ms": 468070,
      "text": "还有整整四十位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00191",
      "start_ms": 468570,
      "end_ms": 470650,
      "text": "每一个都值得你读给孩子听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00192",
      "start_ms": 471250,
      "end_ms": 472950,
      "text": "这本书叫国之几两。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00193",
      "start_ms": 472950,
      "end_ms": 474525,
      "text": "链接放在左下角小了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00194",
      "start_ms": 474940,
      "end_ms": 476480,
      "text": "感兴趣可以拍下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00195",
      "start_ms": 476480,
      "end_ms": 477300,
      "text": "放在枕边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a3c17f15ee2bfb2_s00196",
      "start_ms": 477400,
      "end_ms": 478145,
      "text": "细细品读。"
    }
  ],
